<title>UK: Lnd precious metals end mixed, palladium leads.</title>
<headline>Lnd precious metals end mixed, palladium leads.</headline>
<text>
<p>PALLADIUM- Closed at $155.50/$156.50, down $2.00 but above low hit on unconfirmed report suggested Russia could start palladium exports to Japan this month. Volatile.</p>
<p>GOLD - Finished at $352.40/$352.90, up $1.25. Off bottom hit with palladium. Stuck in $351.00-$355.00 range.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Ended down $0.60 at $381.40/$382.40.</p>
<p>SILVER - Closed at $5.24/$5.26, up six cents. Quiet.</p>
</text>
